25. Triggering Builds
Poll SCM

Jenkins checks Git periodically.

pollSCM('* * * * *')

Checks every minute.

Webhook (Recommended)

GitHub directly informs Jenkins.

GitHub Push
      ↓
Webhook
      ↓
Jenkins Build

Faster than polling.

